{"id":"vod_sn_36568","vodId":"36568","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"暗芝居第一季","name_cn":"暗芝居第一季","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/28b3d2fc406c0ca98d1b52972f967f91.jpg"},"summary":"本片是一部带有浓郁昭和气息的怪谈动画，每集开头均为傍晚黄昏，著名实力派男星津田宽治配音的江湖艺人高声吆喝，招揽顾客，以洋片（紙芝居）的形式讲述一个又一个短小精悍却恐怖阴森的都市怪谈。如新搬入的公寓贴着奇怪符咒、不断能印出发丝的复印机、为了防止被上身而不得不彻夜欢笑的家族、直通地下13层的诡异电梯……每集均在最紧张时刻戛然而止，使观者在恐慌之际又留下无限回味空间，其风格与《新耳袋》和《毛骨悚然撞鬼经》有异曲同工之妙。故做古旧拙朴的画面和风格幽异的片尾曲，更加为这部短剧增色不少。此外，官网还不定期提供短篇小说供爱好者阅读。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:44:16","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/nE29skgtgs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3t36feyQN61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/09fZxb7CEB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/db4mZAMNq21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jR4qPT7Dj11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hS47t5Di3E1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gTeQy0f2tx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5Ht4xqgmiX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gq2aWvrnxS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Sm6wCEEUiU1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/suqisjq2RZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nvit38AAbL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dzAQ8GyPjc1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:21.174Z"}